  "question": {
    "text": "The total number of words (with or without meaning) that can be formed out of the letters of the word \"DISTRIBUTION\" taken four at a time, is equal to ______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3734",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Word <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>'</mo><mi>DISTRIBUTION</mi><mo>'</mo></math></p><p>Now, we have <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>III</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>TT</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>Number of words with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> alike letter and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> different will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p><p>Number of words with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> alike and other <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> alike will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Number of words with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> alike and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> different will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>672</mn></math></p><p>Number of words with all different letters will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3024</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, the total number of ways will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3024</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>672</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3734</mn></math></p>"
  }
